    "sourceGaps": [
      "One connected whole assignment includes two linked original schemes, twelve scheme transformations, source conditionsa–e and all twenty-four printed reaction keys. The compiler alternates the polysulfide notation $\\mathrm{K_2S}_{(x+1)}$ and $\\mathrm{K_2S}_x$; these actual symbols and every original coefficient remain literal. No rebalancing, inferred solution or independently split new tasks are supplied.",
      "Historical original single-pass checkpoint80f51f...af29 covers actual physical224–226, printed221–223. Three already personally opened final native300dpi crops are bound to crop plan9d78c7...455; zero fresh original-page credit. This is editable working Markdown only, not a candidate, receipt or publication. Volume 1 archive/compiler teaching source, Anton Sirota / IChO International Information Centre, ©2008 IUVENTA, Not for sale; native common rights/editorial recreation qualifications apply.",
      "The source230 first concentration row visibly prints a superscript2 on the initial hydrogen-ion concentration while its following fractions have first-power concentration; that source inconsistency is retained. The previous own working transcription reversed these fractions and omitted the superscript; this bounded successor restores the actual already-read original pixels without changing any numerical results.\n\nThe prior derivative row retains the source’s inconsistent bracket grouping and the square-root row retains its printed unclosed parenthesis. The original prior partial working file remains unchanged. Its former page230 boundary gap is now completed by the actual native230 key, without inferring a filled answer form.",
      "This is the archive compilation *The Competition Problems from the International Chemistry Olympiads*, Volume 1, edited by Anton Sirota, IChO International Information Centre, Bratislava, Slovakia; ©2008 IUVENTA. The volume permits attributed use of parts for unlimited teaching and is marked “Not for sale”. Its editorial introduction qualifies recreated and recalculated material. These are compiler/archive questions and printed keys; independent original jury provenance and a commercial permission grant are not asserted.",
      "Actual personally read native physical 230 newly read; exact historical227–229 and three original crops reused with zero fresh credit; complete55 checkpoint d8779900…3af48. Crop packet2e6d1bd1…988dc binds exact original300dpi regions and actual own-reader final crop openings. This working transcription adds zero original reading credit, no separate checker, no public upload, candidate, receipt, READY, source-owner or shared state write. Physical285–408 remain excluded and unread."
